# Software Bill of Materials (SBOM)
What Is It? Why Does It Matter?

17 June 2026
Edmonton Go Meetup
Peter Preeper
ppreeper@gmail.com

## Agenda
.background images/golang_slide_blue.png

- What is an SBOM?
- Why does it exist? — The supply chain attack crisis from Log4j onward
- Why does it matter? — Security, compliance, trust
